<title>NETHERLANDS: TABLE - Oce 1996/97 Q2 net NLG 58.8 mln.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Oce 1996/97 Q2 net NLG 58.8 mln.</headline>
<dateline>VENLO, Netherlands 1997-07-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Second quarter to May</p>
<p>31, 1997 (in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net per shr (guilders)	     2.86 vs   2.33</p>
<p>    Net profit			    58.8  vs  41.2</p>
<p>    Turnover (billions)		  1.32 vs   1.02</p>
<p>    Operating profit		   108.0  vs  79.5</p>
<p>    Interest charges		    29.4  vs  28.3</p>
<p>    Tax				     18.1  vs  10.1</p>
<p>NOTE - Copier maker Oce NV previously said it expected the 1996/97 net profit rise to outstrip sales growth.  </p>
<p>    Interest income from leases     38.7  vs  30.8</p>
<p>    Associates' income		   0.1  vs   0.1</p>
<p>    Minorities interests charge	1.4  vs   nil</p>
<p>    Dividend on preference shares    2.0  vs   nil</p>
<p>Net attributable to</p>
<p>    ordinary shareholders	     56.8  vs  41.2</p>
<p>    Cash flow			    142.0  vs 115.4</p>
<p>    Cash flow per shr (guilders)     7.03 vs   6.53</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
